-- Approved 30-minute caller flow: clarify fragments, ask missing tax year, agree on filing target before callback.
UPDATE public.daisy_call_scripts SET history=coalesce(history,'[]'::jsonb)||jsonb_build_array(jsonb_build_object('version',version,'title',title,'category',category,'direction',direction,'content',content,'saved_at',now())),content=content||jsonb_build_object('script_text','[PrepHub:tax_missing_year]\nI understand you’re missing one year’s tax return. What year are you missing?\n\n'||(content->>'script_text'),'key_points',coalesce(content->'key_points','[]'::jsonb)||$points$["Unfinished answers such as The or I was are not agreement. Keep the current question, wait briefly for the rest, and if nothing follows ask: Sorry, what were you saying? Never advance or invent a completed answer.","When intake reports exactly one missing tax return, ask: I understand you’re missing one year’s tax return. What year are you missing? A bare year answers which return is missing. If the customer instead says which year was filed, preserve that fact and identify the other missing year. Do not re-ask a year already known from supported selections or this call.","After the tax selections are saved and the assistant introduction is acknowledged, skip the general resource tour when a return still needs filing. State the actual missing year and ask when they expect to file it. Record their exact answer as a client-reported target, not a verified filing or booked appointment. Then ask the saved follow-up invitation and use the existing callback scheduler; only confirm a callback after it is saved. Answer questions and offer requested tax help without changing the filing facts."]$points$::jsonb),version=version+1,updated_at=now() WHERE script_number=40 AND version=29 AND deleted_at IS NULL;
